WEBVTT

00:04:57.395 --> 00:05:01.169
Similarly, face surveillance
enables a centralized authority --

00:05:01.193 --> 00:05:03.077
in this case, the state --

00:05:03.101 --> 00:05:06.458
to monitor the totality
of human movement and association

00:05:06.482 --> 00:05:07.632
in public space.

00:05:08.053 --> 00:05:09.450
And here's what it looks like

00:05:09.474 --> 00:05:10.846
in real life.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.672
In this case, it's not a guard in a tower,

00:05:13.696 --> 00:05:16.974
but rather a police analyst
in a spy center.

00:05:17.506 --> 00:05:20.656
The prison expands beyond its walls,

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.562
encompassing everyone,

00:05:22.586 --> 00:05:25.077
everywhere, all the time.

00:05:26.189 --> 00:05:27.498
In a free society,

00:05:27.522 --> 00:05:29.926
this should terrify us all.